# Stage 2a target-text manifest — CANDIDATE, NOT RATIFIED

> **This file is the commission §4.2 output path and is under construction.** It is not ratified, is not
> owner-approved wording, and must not be used to begin Stage 2b or to edit `DECISIONS.md`. Two sentinel
> classes mark unfinished bytes, each delimited by a doubled at-sign so that neither can occur in ordinary
> prose: a measurement sentinel, which names the slot it waits on, and one append-point sentinel at the end
> of the assembled bytes. **The manifest is not ratifiable while a sentinel of either class survives
> anywhere in this file.** Ratifiability is therefore an exact fixed-string search rather than an
> inspection, and this file never reproduces a sentinel string in explanatory prose — so a clear search
> result means the manifest is genuinely complete, not merely self-describing. That is how commission
> §2.2's no-placeholder rule is satisfied by construction.

