## Section numbering convention

This manifest's own sections are numbered `M0`–`M9` so that a bare `§3` in this file is never ambiguous
between the manifest and the target document. Target `DECISIONS.md` sections are always written as
"target §N". Commission sections are always written as "commission §N".

