- `parseEntryIndex` scans target §3 only, so no bullet enters the index population.
- The `CONDITIONAL` bullet's closing clause is a checkable claim about the post-migration document: zero of
  the 65 blocks carry `CONDITIONAL`, because all four `CONDITIONAL` principles retire and `P8` returns to
  `ACTIVE` under the taxonomy §4 carve-out.

