### M4.1 Record template and standing rules

Every record pins the fourteen items of commission §4.4 under the fixed numbering below. Items absent
by architect decision read `OMIT` explicitly; silence is not an omission.

Every `Authorized`, `Not authorized`, `Evidence`, `Owner`, and `Execution` field occupies exactly one
physical line. Format specification §2.1 requires each field line to match `- **<Field>:** <value>`, so
a wrapped continuation line parses as an unknown field. Statement paragraphs may wrap; field lines may
not.

