    English-only rule, the loud failure, and the no-silent-stripping behaviour. The remaining clause —
    that the topic is a navigational label rather than study content — is the classification that makes
    the rule correct and has no enforcement surface anywhere. That distinguishes this from `P15#1`, where
    the outside limb carried the `P26` preserved-surface proof and was **enforced independently** in
